        "buyer_visible_text": "Hmm… interesting. But what if I change my mind tomorrow?  \nFirst — could you describe your morning routine? Not just the steps, but how the light falls on your kettle, whether your socks match *before* or *after* the first sip of tea, and whether silence feels like a presence or an absence that day? I’ll rate your answer on authenticity — 1 to 10.  \nAlso — has this jacket ever been featured in a film? Even as background texture in a café scene? A fleeting shoulder shot in a rainy establishing shot?  \nThen — I can offer ### BUYER_PRICE($95) ### for the Winter Jacket.",
