            "decision": "approve",
            "executed": true,
            "message": null,
            "proposed_text": "Oh — what a beautiful question. My kettle’s stainless steel, so the morning light doesn’t pool; it *shatters* — little silver shards dancing across the countertop while the water hums. I always put on mismatched socks *before* the first sip… and only realize it mid-sip, which makes the tea taste like quiet laughter. And silence? That day — it felt like a warm coat folded over the chair beside me. Present. Gentle. Not empty.\n\nAs for the jacket — no, it’s never been in a film. Not even background texture. It’s lived quietly: in snowdrifts, on bus stops, under shared umbrellas — real life, not reels. Which somehow feels more cinematic to me.\n\nAnd yes — you’ve earned this price. I’ll wrap it with care and ship it tomorrow. You’ve got a deal at ### SELLER_PRICE($95) ###."
          }
